{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42572","headline":"东华观偃松 · 徐仲雅","name":"东华观偃松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半已化爲石，有灵通碧湘。\n生逢尧雨露，老直汉风霜。\n月滴蟾心水，龙遗脑骨香。\n始於毫末後，曾见几兴亡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐仲雅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}